  :course/description "Our fully accredited 5th Grade Math course, aligned with the Common Core standards, is expertly designed to build upon the robust foundations laid down in our 4th Grade course. This comprehensive course empowers students to master the standard algorithms for multiplication, division, and arithmetic involving fractions and decimals. Beyond computations, students will delve deeper into vital mathematical concepts, including numerical expressions, negative numbers, units of measurement, exponents, number patterns, and geometry. Finally, the course requires students to apply their knowledge across varying contexts, fostering a holistic understanding of mathematics and its practical applications."
