    {:course-outcome/id #uuid "d4f7d043-196a-5ed3-ae42-4e18a31b86d5"
     :course-outcome/index 4
     :course-outcome/text "Apply differentiation techniques to various contextual situations, such as interpreting and estimating derivatives, analyzing particle motion, and solving related rates problems."
