    {:course-outcome/id #uuid "4d96770d-0b5a-58cf-ae25-1ca1ac3ef23b"
     :course-outcome/index 5
     :course-outcome/text "Delve into analytical applications of differentiation, including L'Hopital's Rule, the Mean Value Theorem, and linearization."
     :db/ensure :course-outcome/validate}
    {:course-outcome/id #uuid "4fd977b7-8d08-5073-b611-1eeeed947f56"
     :course-outcome/index 6
     :course-outcome/text "Analyzing curves by finding and classifying critical points, deducing concavity over an interval, and finding inflection points,"
